  minus K x(1+x)^(K-1), simplified -> Piecewise((0, x <= 1), (-K*x*(x + 1)**(K - 1) + Sum(r*x**r*binomial(K, r), (r, 0, K)), True))   [0 means CONFIRMED, symbolic K]

